# Secrets — SECURITY.md §7
# Ignore EVERY .env variant, then re-admit the committed template. `.env*.local`
# alone missed .env.production / .env.development — which is precisely where the
# Paymob secret key and the Supabase service role key would end up.
.env
.env*
!.env.example

# Credentials and keys of any kind
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx

# Supabase CLI local state (can contain project refs and access tokens)
.supabase/

# Supabase CLI local state
supabase/.temp/
supabase/.branches/

.DS_Store
*.log
.vercel
